There’s danger in ignoring corruption.
There’s also danger in staring at it too long.

I’ve shared tools to download the Epstein files directly from the Justice source — because truth should be preserved at its origin, not filtered through narratives.

If the source goes down, what replaces it?
Speculation. Manipulation. Distortion.

Archive responsibly.
Examine clearly.
Don’t let the mirror warp you.

